WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:13.013
- BROTHERS.
BROTHERS, LET US BEGIN.

00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:17.918
I HAVE CONVENED THIS MEETING
TO FIND OUT WHAT YOU ARE DOING.

00:00:17.951 --> 00:00:23.156
WHY HAVE WE NOT TAKEN A PLANE
IN 13 YEARS?

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:28.161
- KHALIV.
YOU DON'T EVEN KNOW.

00:00:28.195 --> 00:00:33.901
IT IS ALL BECAUSE THE CUNNING
AND MIGHTY TSA

00:00:33.934 --> 00:00:36.703
IS ALWAYS ONE STEP AHEAD OF US.

00:00:36.737 --> 00:00:39.540
- I DO NOT BELIEVE IT!
- IT'S TRUE.

00:00:39.573 --> 00:00:42.843
LAST MONTH,
I ATTEMPTED TO TAKE DOWN A PLANE

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:44.745
WITH A PAIR OF SCISSORS
FIVE INCHES LONG.

00:00:44.778 --> 00:00:47.447
- THAT SOUNDS
LIKE A PERFECT PLAN.

00:00:47.481 --> 00:00:49.116
WHY DID IT NOT WORK?

00:00:49.149 --> 00:00:54.254
- BECAUSE THE SHREWD TSA,

00:00:54.288 --> 00:00:55.656
THEY MADE RESTRICTIONS

00:00:55.689 --> 00:00:58.325
SO YOU CAN ONLY
TAKE A FOUR-INCH SCISSORS.

00:00:58.358 --> 00:00:59.326
FOUR INCHES.
- WHAT?

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:00.527
- YEAH.

00:01:00.561 --> 00:01:01.895
- HOW COULD THEY KNOW
THAT A FIVE-INCH BLADE

00:01:01.929 --> 00:01:03.897
IS A DANGEROUS WEAPON
AND A FOUR-INCH BLADE

00:01:03.931 --> 00:01:05.899
IS NO MORE
THAN A CHILD'S PLAY THING?

00:01:05.933 --> 00:01:09.303
- THAT IS THE GENIUS OF TSA.

00:01:09.336 --> 00:01:11.171
THEY FOIL US AT EVERY TURN.

00:01:11.205 --> 00:01:13.340
- DEVILS!

00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:15.509
- YOU KNOW, IT'S THE SAME WAY
WITH THE LIQUID.

00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:17.311
- OH, YEAH.

00:01:17.344 --> 00:01:18.679
- WE ALL KNOW
HOW MUCH DEVASTATION

00:01:18.712 --> 00:01:21.715
WE CAN WREAK WITH 3.5 OUNCES
OF LIQUID.

00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:23.984
- THE--THE DAMAGE
IS INCALCULABLE.

00:01:24.017 --> 00:01:25.552
- THE CRAFTY TSA,

00:01:25.586 --> 00:01:29.790
THEY HAVE LIMITED PASSENGERS
TO ONLY 3.4 OUNCES.

00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:30.791
- DAMN IT!

00:01:30.824 --> 00:01:31.925
- YEAH.

00:01:31.959 --> 00:01:34.528
- DO NONE OF YOU
HAVE THE SOLUTION HOW--

00:01:34.561 --> 00:01:36.697
FOR US TO THWART THIS TSA?

00:01:36.730 --> 00:01:38.031
- KHALIV, KHALIV.

00:01:38.065 --> 00:01:42.002
IT'S LIKE YOU'VE BEEN
LIVING IN A--WELL, HERE.

00:01:42.035 --> 00:01:46.640
LOOK...THE TSA,
THEY STRIKE FEAR INTO MY HEART

00:01:46.673 --> 00:01:48.876
WITH THEIR POLYESTER SHIRTS

00:01:48.909 --> 00:01:52.746
AND THEIR DISPOSABLE RUBBER
GLOVES.

00:01:52.779 --> 00:01:55.816
AND THE--AND THE--
THE SNEAKER SHOES!

00:01:55.849 --> 00:01:57.818
- THEY ARE SO CLEVER.

00:01:57.851 --> 00:01:59.286
- CLEVER.
- YES.

00:01:59.319 --> 00:02:03.624
THEY--THEY ACT AS IF THEY ARE
LISTLESS, OVERWEIGHT EMPLOYEES

00:02:03.657 --> 00:02:05.626
WHO DON'T GIVE A FUCK.

00:02:05.659 --> 00:02:08.061
WHEN IN REALITY,

00:02:08.095 --> 00:02:12.366
THEY ARE AN ELITE FORCE
OF ANTI-TERRORIST COMMANDOS!

00:02:12.399 --> 00:02:16.236
- OH, CURSE THE BRILLIANT TSA.

00:02:16.270 --> 00:02:17.571
- IF I MAY.

00:02:17.604 --> 00:02:23.243
I BELIEVE I HAVE A WAY
TO TRIUMPH OVER THE WILY TSA.

00:02:23.277 --> 00:02:25.212
- FINALLY.
- OKAY.

00:02:25.245 --> 00:02:26.713
- LET'S GIVE HIM A SHOT.

00:02:26.747 --> 00:02:30.484
- I HAVE A PLAN
TO PUT A BOMB IN A LAPTOP,

00:02:30.517 --> 00:02:35.422
AND IT WILL DETONATE
ONCE YOU PULL IT FROM ITS CASE.

00:02:35.455 --> 00:02:38.158
- YES!
YES, IT IS PERFECT!

00:02:38.192 --> 00:02:42.596
PLANES WILL RAIN DOWN
FROM THE SKY ONTO THE INFIDELS!

00:02:42.629 --> 00:02:48.268
[all chanting and singing]

00:02:49.336 --> 00:02:51.305
WHAT?
PARVEZ, WHAT, WHAT, WHAT?

00:02:51.338 --> 00:02:53.974
- S--S--SNEAK IN HERE
FOR A SECOND, 'CAUSE I DON'T--

00:02:54.007 --> 00:02:55.709
I DON'T WANT TO BE THE BEARER
OF BAD NEWS HERE--

00:02:55.742 --> 00:02:57.744
- THEN DON'T BE!
- YET YOU ARE.

00:02:57.778 --> 00:03:03.517
- IT'S AS IF THE PROPHETIC
AND ALL-KNOWING TSA

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:06.386
HAS PREDICTED YOUR PLAN.

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:08.722
THEY MAKE YOU TAKE THE LAPTOP
OUT OF THE CARRYING CASE

00:03:08.755 --> 00:03:10.858
AND PUT IT IN A SEPARATE BIN
BEFORE YOU GET ON THE PLANE.

00:03:10.891 --> 00:03:13.026
- COME ON,
YOU'VE GOT TO BE KIDDING ME.

00:03:13.060 --> 00:03:15.028
YOU'VE GOT TO BE KIDDING ME.

00:03:15.062 --> 00:03:16.697
ARE YOU KIDDING ME, PARVEZ?

00:03:16.730 --> 00:03:18.232
'CAUSE IT'S NOT A FUNNY JOKE
IF IT'S A JOKE.

00:03:18.265 --> 00:03:20.300
- IT'S NO TIME FOR KIDDING.
I WOULDN'T KID.

00:03:20.334 --> 00:03:21.468
- OH, MY GOD.
- NO.

00:03:21.502 --> 00:03:23.770
- I CANNOT BELIEVE
THESE MOTHERS OF DEVILS.

00:03:23.804 --> 00:03:24.838
- YEAH.

00:03:24.872 --> 00:03:26.573
- WELL, VERY WELL, THEN.

00:03:26.607 --> 00:03:28.509
SINCE YOU HAVE ALL FAILED,

00:03:28.542 --> 00:03:32.446
I WILL TELL YOU HOW WE
WILL DESTROY THE NONBELIEVERS.

00:03:32.479 --> 00:03:36.683
I HAVE DEVELOPED
THE SMALLEST BOMB POSSIBLE.

00:03:36.717 --> 00:03:41.688
AND IT FITS PERFECTLY INTO THIS,

00:03:41.722 --> 00:03:46.760
A FULL-SIZED TUBE OF TOOTHPASTE.

00:03:46.793 --> 00:03:49.196
YES!
IT'S REALLY GREAT, ISN'T IT?

00:03:49.229 --> 00:03:50.831
I MEAN, IT'S THE--
- DON'T DO HIM LIKE THAT.

00:03:50.864 --> 00:03:52.232
- WHAT'S GOING ON OVER HERE?

00:03:52.266 --> 00:03:53.534
WHAT'S THE SITUATION OVER HERE?

00:03:53.567 --> 00:03:56.904
- OKAY.

00:03:56.937 --> 00:03:59.573
IS THERE A VERSION
OF THE TOOTHPASTE BOMB

00:03:59.606 --> 00:04:03.076
THAT COMES IN TRAVEL-SIZE?

00:04:03.110 --> 00:04:04.811
- YOU KNOW WHAT?
IT'S LIKE THEY'RE IN OUR HEADS.

